{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Lethalicia Stories&quot; is a command battle-style role-playing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The RPG released by Project Candidates is now available on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You become the main character Jack, running around the field and being robbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The purpose of the journey is to retrieve the royal family's holy sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/extras/4b4ba69e3f16acd1a154e94496adcab5.avif?t=1760093695\" width=400 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd33Meeting friends to share your adventure with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can bring up to 3 companions to accompany you on your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd33Adventure stage Set in Lesalisia, which exists on the continent of Faneia. The world is created with a fusion of retro dots and 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with immediate-X input processors only. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following keyboards are also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/extras/c4e6b21bb8d372cbafbb1eee4536c9cb.avif?t=1760093695\" width=500 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \u2191 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Up\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \uff37 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Up\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \u2193 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Down\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \uff33 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Down\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \u2190 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Left\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \uff21 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Left\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \u2192 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Right\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \uff24 \u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Move Right\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Key +\u3010Shift\u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Dash\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010space\u3011Key \uff1a\u3000\uff08Enter\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Enter\u3011\u00a0Key \u00a0\uff1a \uff08Enter\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 ESC \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 TAB \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 Ctrl \u3011Key \uff1a \uff08Cancel\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 \uff2d \u3011Key\u00a0 \u00a0 \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 ESC \u3011\u00a0Key \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 TAB \u3011\u00a0Key \uff1a\uff08Menu call\uff09</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2014280?t=1760093695","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760093695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/051283a78d6e8f2de001dcc0b118731d7c7529fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760093695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014280/051283a78d6e8f2de001dcc0b118731d7c7529fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760093695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Lethalicia Stories&quot; is a command battle-style role-playing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The RPG released by Project Candidates is now available on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_pa